{"id":"5950e7607222bb8e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ml-measure-one.md","title":"ML 随机序列具有全测度","display":"thm-ml-measure-one — ML 随机序列具有全测度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ml-measure-one","aliases":["20-thm-ml-measure-one"],"display":"thm-ml-measure-one — ML 随机序列具有全测度","chapter":"11","section":"11.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§11.2 通用检验后的测度结论","source_pdf_pages":[222],"source_printed_pages":[191],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-universal-ml]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ml-measure-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ml-measure-one</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ml-measure-one — ML 随机序列具有全测度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§11.2 通用检验后的测度结论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>222</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9cce8d80854a926\" href=\"?note=d9cce8d80854a926\" title=\"20-thm-universal-ml\">20-thm-universal-ml</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MLR}=\\{X:\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{MLR}=\\{X:\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9cce8d80854a926\" href=\"?note=d9cce8d80854a926\" title=\"20-thm-universal-ml\">20-thm-universal-ml</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ml\\text{-}measure\\text{-}one}\\vdash\n\\mu(\\mathsf{MLR})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ml\\text{-}measure\\text{-}one}\\vdash\n\\mu(\\mathsf{MLR})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非随机序列包含于通用检验每一层，测度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span> 对全部 n 成立，因此为零。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.2 通用检验后的测度结论；印刷页 191；PDF 第 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-universal-ml","status":"resolved","id":"d9cce8d80854a926","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-universal-ml]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-universal-ml","status":"resolved","id":"d9cce8d80854a926","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{MLR}=\\{X:\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ml\\text{-}measure\\text{-}one}\\vdash\n\\mu(\\mathsf{MLR})=1.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false}],"bytes":1029,"backlinks":[{"id":"58f8766635c79a79","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ml-measure-one]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-ml-measure-one]] — 章 11；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-ml-measure-one]]"}],"outgoing":["d9cce8d80854a926","978bb51599bc5702"]}